WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:02.008
This is Centaur.

2
00:00:02.688 --> 00:00:05.490
Every screen in Centaur has the Co-pilot on the right.

3
00:00:06.313 --> 00:00:07.370
Let's see what it can do.

4
00:00:08.309 --> 00:00:11.449
Cody's manager, Dana, wants a quick view of the quarter.

5
00:00:12.350 --> 00:00:16.604
She asks: which deals over twenty thousand dollars are closing this month,

6
00:00:16.604 --> 00:00:19.191
and which of them have a competitor involved?

7
00:00:20.453 --> 00:00:22.204
The Co-pilot searches every record.

8
00:00:22.643 --> 00:00:24.234
Not a sample, every one.

9
00:00:24.939 --> 00:00:28.691
And it answers in plain English, in a few seconds: three deals,

10
00:00:28.691 --> 00:00:30.418
with their values and stages.

11
00:00:31.657 --> 00:00:35.818
Northfield Logistics is one of them, with HubSpot named as a challenger.

12
00:00:37.135 --> 00:00:38.383
Dana asks a follow-up.

13
00:00:38.996 --> 00:00:40.329
What's the latest with Northfield?

14
00:00:41.182 --> 00:00:44.713
The Co-pilot reads the deal, the emails and the call summary,

15
00:00:44.713 --> 00:00:49.227
and gives her the story so far, including Priya's proposal deadline on Friday.

16
00:00:50.135 --> 00:00:51.773
Then she asks it to do something.

17
00:00:52.436 --> 00:00:57.393
Log a task for Cody to send the proposal by Thursday, and move the deal to proposal.

18
00:00:58.405 --> 00:01:00.306
The Co-pilot doesn't just go ahead.

19
00:01:01.214 --> 00:01:03.830
It shows Dana exactly what it plans to change,

20
00:01:03.830 --> 00:01:06.275
and nothing happens until she clicks Apply.

21
00:01:07.356 --> 00:01:12.340
It can log calls and tasks, update deals and leads, build marketing lists,

22
00:01:12.340 --> 00:01:14.294
and add people to a sequence.

23
00:01:15.154 --> 00:01:17.127
Every change waits for your OK.

24
00:01:18.193 --> 00:01:19.532
And it never sends an email.

25
00:01:20.302 --> 00:01:21.390
Centaur CRM.

26
00:01:22.148 --> 00:01:24.803
Ask your CRM anything, and get the work done.

27
00:01:25.763 --> 00:01:29.307
Book a demonstration today, at centaurcrm.com.

